cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TOMATO, please cite it as below."
title: "TOMATO: TOMogram Annotation TOol"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/alkemasimon/TOMATO---TOMogram-Annotation-TOol"
abstract: >-
  TOMATO is a lightweight Python GUI for inventorying the contents of
  cryo-ET tomograms. It records one row per tomogram with the structures
  present, optional counts, a quality grade and a comment, and includes an
  orthogonal XYZ viewer. A link command creates symlinks to tomograms
  matching chosen annotations for downstream processing.
keywords:
  - cryo-electron tomography
  - cryo-ET
  - annotation
  - tomogram
  - GUI
